{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY2iG47ph4cvL849HbZ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"statements\":[{\"statement_id\":\"S1\",\"role\":\"finding\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O371\",\"O372\"],\"text\":\"Cancellations of conference room bookings rose to twelve in May. Most cancellations came within two days of the event.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S2\",\"role\":\"hypothesis\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O373\"],\"text\":\"Stricter deposit terms might be pushing clients to book provisionally.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S3\",\"role\":\"limitation\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O374\"],\"text\":\"Reasons for cancelling are not recorded in the booking system.\"},{\"statement_id\":\"S4\",\"role\":\"next_step\",\"observation_ids\":[\"O375\"],\"text\":\"Ask the next five cancelling clients for their reason.\"}],\"conclusion\":\"insufficient_evidence\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":694,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":305,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":44},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}